将会施放第4段普攻攻击目标，造成热熔伤害，此次伤害为普攻伤害，并退出咔咔压制；\n·若短按普攻时已消耗30发【热压弹】，将会施放共鸣技能轰轰，并退出咔咔压制；\n·当【热压弹】消耗完毕后，退出咔咔压制。\n \n共鸣技能·轰轰\n造成热熔伤害，此次伤害为共鸣技能伤害。\n \n热压弹获取规则\n【热压弹】容量上限60发。\n固有技能灼热弹匣可将【热压弹】容量上限扩充10发。\n常态攻击砰砰命中目标时，可积攒【热压弹】。\n施放变奏技能堂堂登场时，可积攒【热压弹】。\n施放共鸣技能咻咻斗意时，可积攒【热压弹】。","descEn":"Resonance Skill: DAKA DAKA!\nHold Resonance Skill Whizzing Fight Spirit to enter DAKA DAKA!. In this state:\n- Chixia continuously consumes \"Thermobaric Bullets\" to attack the target, dealing Fusion DMG, considered as Resonance Skill DMG.\n- Tap Basic Attack to cast Basic Attack 4, dealing Fusion DMG, considered as Basic Attack DMG. Then she exits the \"DAKA DAKA!\" state.\n- If 30 \"Thermobaric Bullets\" have been fired when Basic Attack is activated, Chixia will cast Resonance Skill Boom Boom and exit \"DAKA DAKA!\" state.\n- Chixia exits the \"DAKA DAKA!\" state when all \"Thermobaric Bullets\" are consumed.\n \nResonance Skill: Boom Boom\nDeal Fusion DMG, considered as Resonance Skill DMG.\n \nThermobaric Bullets\nChixia can hold up to 60 \"Thermobaric Bullets\".\nInherent Skill Scorching Magazine increases Max \"Thermobaric Bullets\" by 10.\nChixia obtains \"Thermobaric Bullets\" for every Normal Attack POW POW on hit.\nChixia obtains \"Thermobaric Bullets\" upon casting Intro Skill Grand Entrance and Resonance Skill Whizzing Fight Spirit.","params":[{"label":"热压弹伤害","labelEn":"Thermobaric Bullets Damage","values":["10.00%","10.82%","11.64%","12.79%","13.61%","14.56%","15.87%","17.18%","18.49%","19.89%"]},{"label":"轰轰伤害","labelEn":"Boom Boom Damage","values":["220.00%","238.04%","256.08%","281.34%","299.38%","320.13%","348.99%","377.85%","406.72%","437.39%"]},{"label":"咔咔压制回复协奏能量","labelEn":"DAKA DAKA! Concerto Regen","values":["10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10","10"]},{"label":"每发热压弹回复协奏能量","labelEn":"Thermobaric Bullet Concerto Regen","values":["0.5","0.5","0.5","0.5","0.5","0.5","0.5","0.5","0.5","0.5"]}],"hits":[{"label":"热压弹伤害","labelEn":"Thermobaric Bullets Damage","term":0,"coun